To check docker version / docker --version
To check docker images / docker images
To check docker container / docker ps or docker ps -a
To pull nginx image / docker pull nginx
To create container of nginx / docker run -d --rm --name nc -p 8000:80 nginx
To check the logs of container / docker logs nc
To inspect the attributes of the container / docker inspect nc
To access the container / docker exec -it nc bash
